 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years and July to August in 28. In 2025, the middle of the grids saw March to April at 41% of normal and November to December at 44%. Grid 24420 had its driest year in 2002 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
